          "text": "Dear Colleague,\n\nHistory of Present Illness:\nThe patient has combined generalized and focal epilepsy with onset at 6 years of age. The seizure type is generalized tonic-clonic. Current seizure frequency is approximately one seizure per year. The epilepsy is drug-responsive.\n\nCurrent Medication:\n- Lamotrigine, current antiseizure medication.\n\nSeizure Burden:\nGeneralized tonic-clonic seizures occurring approximately once yearly.\n\nAssessment:\nCombined generalized and focal epilepsy, drug-responsive, with generalized tonic-clonic seizures. The etiology is structural. Brain MRI demonstrates a tumor.\n\nPlan:\n- Continue lamotrigine.\n- Continue monitoring seizure frequency.\n\nSincerely,\nEpilepsy Clinic",
